    "name": "Inside the Crow\u00b4s Nest",
    "steam_appid": 3719120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the Crow 's Nest is a Survival Horror game inspired by old-school genre classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Hunter, who awakens in a cell marked with strange symbols, trapped in a cult-infested monastery. To escape, you must survive horrifying cultists, uncover dark secrets, and solve intricate puzzles that block your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic Survival Horror Feel:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tense, atmospheric gameplay with fixed camera angles and tank controls - an homage to the pioneers of the genre. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging, Rewarding Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect clues, decipher their meaning, and use them to navigate and unlock new areas of the cursed monastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Cultists and Monstrous Horrors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against twisted followers of The Forgotten One\u2014inhuman abominations warped by devotion to their dark god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mystery Waiting to Be Uncovered</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deep into the monastery\u2019s haunted halls and piece together the chilling history of its inhabitants and their eldritch faith. Will the Hunter escape, or become the next sacrifice?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the Crow 's Nest is a Survival Horror game inspired by old-school genre classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Hunter, who awakens in a cell marked with strange symbols, trapped in a cult-infested monastery. To escape, you must survive horrifying cultists, uncover dark secrets, and solve intricate puzzles that block your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic Survival Horror Feel:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tense, atmospheric gameplay with fixed camera angles and tank controls - an homage to the pioneers of the genre. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging, Rewarding Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect clues, decipher their meaning, and use them to navigate and unlock new areas of the cursed monastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Cultists and Monstrous Horrors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against twisted followers of The Forgotten One\u2014inhuman abominations warped by devotion to their dark god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mystery Waiting to Be Uncovered</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deep into the monastery\u2019s haunted halls and piece together the chilling history of its inhabitants and their eldritch faith. Will the Hunter escape, or become the next sacrifice?</p>",
